'''Bad to Worse''' (弱り目に祟り目, ''Yowarime ni Tatarime'', '''Weakness Comes Before Misfortune''') is an event added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]]. It technically contains only one level, but when beating the first level, there will be a chance to progress to a [[Continuation Stage]]. It appears on the '''6th''' and the '''7th''' of every month.

